# Memory Map

The ROM was initialized with test data:

| Address | Data       |
|---------|------------|
|  0000   |  10101010  |
|  0001   |  11110000  |
|  0010   |  01010101  |
|  0011   |  00001111  |
|  0100   |  11001100  |
|  0101   |  00110011  |
|  0110   |  11111111  |
|  0111   |  00000000  |

The remaining addresses were also initialized to known values for simulation and verification.

