# Architecture

                 Address
                    │
                    ▼
             ┌─────────────┐
             │             │
             │     ROM     │
             │             │
             │ Memory Array│
             │             │
             └──────┬──────┘
                    │
                    ▼
                 Data Out

The address input selects one location in the memory array.

The data stored at that location is then returned through the data output.

